v0.1.0
  Initial release.

  * Added commandline tool `vup` to read a version from standard input and print
    the bumped version to standard output.
  * Added tests for `vup` bumping logic and parsing (mostly) compliant SemVer
    versions
  * Added crate `vup` separate from `vup-cli` to allow bumping code to be used
    in other Rust projects
